 r←Setup opt;File2Ref;Import;ImportFile;ImportItem;get_file
⍝ Import dependencies for CACHE modules
⍝ Imported names and ⎕USING must not be localised
 ImportItem←⍎⍤{
    ⍺: ImportFile ⍵
    File2Ref ⍵
 }
 ImportFile←{⊃2⎕FIX'file://',opt.app_dir,'/APLSource/',⍵}
 File2Ref←{'##.',1↓∊'.',¨'/'(≠⊆⊢)⍵/⍨~∨\'.'=⍵}
 get_file ← #.isolate.isSlave
 Import←get_file∘ImportItem

 GetEnv←Import'GetEnv.aplf'
 ReadJSON←Import'ReadJSON.aplf'
 Unidecode←Import'Unidecode.apln'
 Unidecode.MakeCharMap opt.app_dir,'/APLSource/charmap.json'
 SQL←Import'SQL.apln'
 Table2JSON←Import'QUERY/Table2JSON.aplf'
 TimeStamp2DDN←Import'QUERY/TimeStamp2DDN.aplf'
 ComputeSearch←Import'CACHE/ComputeSearch.aplf'
 ComputeRecommendations←Import'CACHE/ComputeRecommendations.aplf'

 ⎕USING←opt.using   ⍝ Load .NET / NuGet DLLs. Defines names in ⎕THIS.

